OL,3,GNEWSAToo much of Scotland's care
OL,4,A'Promise' remains on paper, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report has found a flagship SNP
OL,7,Fpolicy - championed by Nicola Sturgeon
OL,8,F- is running out of time to improve the
OL,9,Fcare system.
OL,11,FThe Scottish government signed up to
OL,12,FThe Promise in 2020 to make the lives
OL,13,Fof care-experienced children and young
OL,14,Fpeople better by 2030.
OL,16,FAn update on its progress reveals too
OL,17,Fmuch of the pledge made to Scotland's
OL,18,Fchildren, families and care-experienced
OL,19,Fadults remains on paper, not in
OL,20,Fpeople's lives.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
